  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Consistency checks\n[t1(u),t1(v)]=0, [t1,t3]=0 for G_c(z); and <0_w| is an exact eigenbra of the w-twisted t1, t3.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsA = wsT1[1/3, wsGz]; wsB = wsT1[-2/5, wsGz]; wsC = wsT3[2/9, wsGz];\nwsGw = wsGc[wsW1]; wsPsi = wsVac[wsW1];\nwsChk = Module[{r1 = wsPsi . wsT1[1/3, wsGw], r3 = wsPsi . wsT3[2/9, wsGw], e1, e3},\n  e1 = r1[[1]]/wsPsi[[1]]; e3 = r3[[1]]/wsPsi[[1]];\n  {e1, e3, Max[Abs[r1 - e1 wsPsi]], Max[Abs[r3 - e3 wsPsi]], Max[Abs[Normal[wsA . wsB - wsB . wsA]]], Max[Abs[Normal[wsA . wsC - wsC . wsA]]]}];\nGrid[Transpose[{{\"eigenvalue t1^w(1/3)\", \"eigenvalue t3^w(2/9)\", \"residual t1 eigen\", \"residual t3 eigen\", \"max|[t1(u),t1(v)]| (z)\", \"max|[t1,t3]| (z)\"}, wsChk}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
