  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Generators (z-twisted, G_c(z))\nt1(theta_s + m h), m in {-2..2}; t3(theta_s + m h), m in {-1..3}; inverses of t1(theta_s). Zero matrices (t3 at its g-zeros) are dropped. Faster monodromy (computed once).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsT1[u_, G_] := Module[{M = wsMono[Table[wsLax[s, u], {s, 4}]]}, Sum[G[[j, i]] M[[i, j]], {i, 4}, {j, 4}]];\nwsT3[u_, G_] := Module[{X = Det[G] Transpose[Inverse[G]], M = wsMono[Table[wsLaxBar[s, u], {s, 4}]]}, Product[wsGg[s, u], {s, 4}] Sum[X[[b, a]] M[[a, b]], {a, 4}, {b, 4}]];\nwsGenList = {};\nDo[Module[{m1 = wsT1[wsTh[[s]] + m wsH, wsGz]}, If[Max[Abs[m1[\"NonzeroValues\"]]] =!= 0, AppendTo[wsGenList, {{\"t1\", s, m}, m1}]]], {s, 4}, {m, -2, 2}];\nDo[Module[{m3 = wsT3[wsTh[[s]] + m wsH, wsGz]}, If[Length[m3[\"NonzeroValues\"]] > 0 && Max[Abs[m3[\"NonzeroValues\"]]] =!= 0, AppendTo[wsGenList, {{\"t3\", s, m}, m3}]]], {s, 4}, {m, -1, 3}];\nwsInvList = Table[{{\"t1inv\", s}, LinearSolve[Transpose[Normal[wsT1[wsTh[[s]], wsGz]]]]}, {s, 4}];\nGrid[{{\"# t1/t3 generators\", Length[wsGenList]}, {\"# inverses\", Length[wsInvList]}, {\"labels\", Column[wsGenList[[All, 1]]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
