  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Word span and the sublattice S12 (sites 3,4 unchanged)\nWords: identity, all single generators, all products of two generators (generators commute). For each word the bra <0_w|W is a 256-vector. S = span; S12 = {psi in S : psi = x (x) v_w (x) u_w}, imposed linearly as M_psi . Pperp = 0 with M the (sites 12) x (sites 34) matricisation and Pperp = 1 - f f^T/(f.f), f = v_w (x) u_w.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsNG = Length[wsGenList] + Length[wsInvList];\nwsApply[v_, k_] := If[k <= Length[wsGenList], v . wsGenList[[k, 2]], wsInvList[[k - Length[wsGenList], 2]][v]];\nwsGenLabel[k_] := If[k <= Length[wsGenList], wsGenList[[k, 1]], wsInvList[[k - Length[wsGenList], 1]]];\nwsWordVecs[w_] := Module[{psi = wsVac[w], v1, out = {}},\n  AppendTo[out, {{}, psi}];\n  v1 = Table[wsApply[psi, k], {k, wsNG}];\n  Do[AppendTo[out, {{k}, v1[[k]]}], {k, wsNG}];\n  Do[AppendTo[out, {{k, l}, wsApply[v1[[k]], l]}], {k, wsNG}, {l, k, wsNG}];\n  out];\nwsAnalyse[w_, words_] := Module[{psi = wsVac[w], f, Pp, vecs, B, r, Cm, ns, psis, xs, rr},\n  f = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[wsVec[w], wsUvec[w]]];\n  Pp = IdentityMatrix[16] - Outer[Times, f, f]/(f . f);\n  vecs = words[[All, 2]];\n  B = RowReduce[vecs]; B = Select[B, # =!= ConstantArray[0, 256] &]; r = Length[B];\n  Cm = Table[Flatten[ArrayReshape[B[[i]], {16, 16}] . Pp], {i, r}];\n  ns = NullSpace[Transpose[Cm]];\n  psis = ns . B;\n  xs = Table[ArrayReshape[ArrayReshape[p, {16, 16}] . f/(f . f), {4, 4}], {p, psis}];\n  rr = If[xs === {}, {}, RowReduce[Map[Flatten, xs]]];\n  <|\"rank\" -> r, \"dimS12\" -> Length[ns], \"xs\" -> (ArrayReshape[#, {4, 4}] & /@ rr), \"B\" -> B, \"ns\" -> ns|>];\nwsWords1 = wsWordVecs[wsW1];\nwsRes1 = wsAnalyse[wsW1, wsWords1];\nGrid[{{\"# words\", Length[wsWords1]}, {\"rank S\", wsRes1[\"rank\"]}, {\"dim S12\", wsRes1[\"dimS12\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
