  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. Structure of S12 (generic w = W1)\nTest candidate pair states for membership in S12 (as 4x4 matrices x_ab, row index = site 1, column = site 2). Notation: v=v_w, u=u_w, G=G_c(z). Candidates: v(x)u, v(x)uG, vG^T(x)u, singlet S=Id, vG^T(x)uG, vG^-T(x)u, v(x)uG^-1, vG^-T(x)uG, vG^T(x)uG^-1.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsCands[w_] := Module[{v = wsVec[w], u = wsUvec[w], G = wsGz, Gi},\n  Gi = Inverse[G];\n  <|\"v(x)u\" -> Outer[Times, v, u], \"v(x)uG\" -> Outer[Times, v, u . G], \"vG^T(x)u\" -> Outer[Times, v . Transpose[G], u], \"S\" -> IdentityMatrix[4],\n    \"vG^T(x)uG\" -> Outer[Times, v . Transpose[G], u . G], \"vG^-T(x)u\" -> Outer[Times, v . Transpose[Gi], u], \"v(x)uG^-1\" -> Outer[Times, v, u . Gi],\n    \"vG^-T(x)uG\" -> Outer[Times, v . Transpose[Gi], u . G], \"vG^T(x)uG^-1\" -> Outer[Times, v . Transpose[G], u . Gi], \"vG^-T(x)uG^-1\" -> Outer[Times, v . Transpose[Gi], u . Gi]|>];\nwsInSpan[xs_, c_] := Module[{A = Map[Flatten, xs]}, MatrixRank[Append[A, Flatten[c]]] == MatrixRank[A]];\nwsMemb[w_, res_] := With[{c = wsCands[w]}, Grid[Prepend[Table[{k, wsInSpan[res[\"xs\"], c[k]]}, {k, Keys[c]}], {\"candidate\", \"in S12?\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]];\nwsMemb[wsW1, wsRes1]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"131\" data-out-n=\"1246\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"10\" data-sub-start=\"7\" data-sub-end=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1246]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:13.24em;vertical-align:-6.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:13.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">candidate</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">v(x)u</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">v(x)uG</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span 