  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 6. Rank-1 locus in S12\nBasis completed to {v(x)u, vG^-T(x)u, vG^-T(x)uG, x4}; solve all 2x2 minors of x = sum lambda_i x_i (projective).",
