  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 7. Direct tests of single words (4(i))\nFor psi' = <0_w|W compute the defect ||M Pperp|| (zero iff sites 3,4 are unchanged) and, when zero, x = M f/(f.f).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsFvec[w_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[wsVec[w], wsUvec[w]]];\nwsDefect[w_, psi_] := Module[{f = wsFvec[w], Pp}, Pp = IdentityMatrix[16] - Outer[Times, f, f]/(f . f); Max[Abs[ArrayReshape[psi, {16, 16}] . Pp]]];\nwsXof[w_, psi_] := Module[{f = wsFvec[w]}, ArrayReshape[ArrayReshape[psi, {16, 16}] . f/(f . f), {4, 4}]];\nwsT1z[s_, m_] := wsGenList[[First[FirstPosition[wsGenList[[All, 1]], {\"t1\", s, m}]], 2]];\nwsPsiW1 = wsVac[wsW1];\nwsD = wsPsiW1 . wsT1z[2, 0] - wsPsiW1 . wsT1z[1, 0];\nwsRow[name_, psi_] := {name, wsDefect[wsW1, psi]};\nGrid[Prepend[{wsRow[\"t1(th1)\", wsPsiW1 . wsT1z[1, 0]], wsRow[\"t1(th2)\", wsPsiW1 . wsT1z[2, 0]], wsRow[\"t1(th3)\", wsPsiW1 . wsT1z[3, 0]], wsRow[\"t1(th4)\", wsPsiW1 . wsT1z[4, 0]], wsRow[\"t1(th2)-t1(th1)\", wsD], wsRow[\"t1(th4)-t1(th3)\", wsPsiW1 . wsT1z[4, 0] - wsPsiW1 . wsT1z[3, 0]]}, {\"word\", \"defect\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"140\" data-out-n=\"1293\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"14\" data-sub-start=\"7\" data-sub-end=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1293]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.4655em;vertical-align:-3.9628em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.5028em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.4628em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4628em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4255em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.9628em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.4628em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.6228em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">word</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.4177em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">t1(th1)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.2177em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">t1(th2)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0126em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">t1(th3)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8074em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">t1(th4)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">t1(th2)-t1(th1)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.6028em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">t1(th4)-t1(th3)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.9628em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4255em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.9628em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.4628em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.6228em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">defect</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.4177em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">18806985945931491737600000</span></span></span></span><span style=\"to