  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 8. Summaries for W1, W2 (generic) and the locus point w1 = z1\nFor each: rank S, dim S12, candidate membership, rank-1 families (solutions of the 2x2 minors in the rref basis of S12) with v', u', B1 = v'.u_w, B2 = v_w.u'.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsFamilies[w_, res_] := Module[{xs = res[\"xs\"], d, lam, x, sol, v = wsVec[w], u = wsUvec[w], out},\n  d = Length[xs]; If[d == 0, Return[{}]];\n  lam = Array[Symbol[\"wsl\" <> ToString[#]] &, d];\n  x = lam . xs;\n  sol = Solve[Thread[wsMinors[x] == 0], lam];\n  out = Table[Module[{xx = Simplify[x /. s], pos, i, j, vp, up},\n    pos = FirstPosition[xx, e_ /; e =!= 0, None, {2}, Heads -> False];\n    If[pos === None, {s, \"zero\"}, {i, j} = pos; vp = xx[[All, j]]; up = xx[[i]]/xx[[i, j]];\n      {s, <|\"x\" -> xx, \"v'\" -> Simplify[vp], \"u'\" -> Simplify[up], \"B1\" -> Simplify[vp . u], \"B2\" -> Simplify[v . up]|>}]], {s, sol}];\n  out];\nwsSummary[w_] := Module[{words = wsWordVecs[w], res, fam},\n  res = wsAnalyse[w, words]; fam = wsFamilies[w, res];\n  <|\"w\" -> w, \"rank\" -> res[\"rank\"], \"dimS12\" -> res[\"dimS12\"], \"xs\" -> res[\"xs\"], \"memb\" -> With[{c = wsCands[w]}, Table[k -> wsInSpan[res[\"xs\"], c[k]], {k, Keys[c]}]], \"fam\" -> fam, \"qq\" -> wsUvec[w] . wsGz . wsVec[w], \"B1inv\" -> wsUvec[w] . Inverse[wsGz] . wsVec[w]|>];\nwsSumW1 = wsSummary[wsW1]; wsSumW2 = wsSummary[wsW2]; wsSumLoc = wsSummary[wsWloc];\nGrid[Prepend[Map[{#[\"w\"], #[\"rank\"], #[\"dimS12\"], #[\"qq\"], #[\"B1inv\"], Length[#[\"fam\"]]} &, {wsSumW1, wsSumW2, wsSumLoc}], {\"w\", \"rank S\", \"dim S12\", \"q = uGv\", \"u G^-1 v\", \"# rank-1 solution branches\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
