  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 9. Structure theorem check (W1, W2) and locus point\nClaim: S12 = span{ v(x)u, vG^-T(x)u, vG^-T(x)uG, S - kappa v(x)uG }, kappa = theta12/(h q). Then rank-1 elements: (a) vG^-T (x) u(a + b G) [v' = vG^-T, B1 = u G^-1 v, B2 = b q], (b) v(a + b G^-T) (x) u [B2 = 0, B1 = b uG^-1 v]. Also test at the locus: stacked column spaces (v') and row spaces (u') of S12.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsStruct[w_, res_] := Module[{c = wsCands[w], q = wsUvec[w] . wsGz . wsVec[w], kap, bas, A, B},\n  kap = (wsTh[[1]] - wsTh[[2]])/(wsH q);\n  bas = {c[\"v(x)u\"], c[\"vG^-T(x)u\"], c[\"vG^-T(x)uG\"], c[\"S\"] - kap c[\"v(x)uG\"]};\n  A = Map[Flatten, res[\"xs\"]]; B = Map[Flatten, bas];\n  {kap, MatrixRank[B], MatrixRank[A], MatrixRank[Join[A, B]], MatrixRank[{wsVec[w], wsVec[w] . Transpose[Inverse[wsGz]]}], MatrixRank[{wsUvec[w], wsUvec[w] . wsGz}]}];\nwsLocInfo[res_] := Module[{xs = res[\"xs\"]}, {MatrixRank /@ xs, MatrixRank[Join @@ (Transpose /@ xs)], MatrixRank[Join @@ xs]}];\nwsStructRows = {Prepend[wsStruct[wsW1, wsSumW1], \"W1\"], Prepend[wsStruct[wsW2, wsSumW2], \"W2\"]};\nwsLocRes = <|\"xs\" -> wsSumLoc[\"xs\"]|>;\nGrid[Join[{{\"w\", \"kappa\", \"rank 4 states\", \"rank S12\", \"rank(S12 + states)\", \"rank{v,vG^-T}\", \"rank{u,uG}\"}}, wsStructRows], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
