  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 10. Do 3-factor words enlarge the span? (W1)\nAdd 400 random triples of generators (commuting, so unordered) to the span of the <=2-factor words and recompute rank S and dim S12.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "SeedRandom[7];\nwsWords1b = wsWords1;\nwsTrip = Table[Module[{ks = Sort[RandomInteger[{1, wsNG}, 3]]}, {ks, wsApply[wsApply[wsApply[wsPsiW1, ks[[1]]], ks[[2]]], ks[[3]]]}], {400}];\nwsRes1b = wsAnalyse[wsW1, Join[wsWords1, wsTrip]];\nGrid[{{\"rank S (<=2 factors)\", wsRes1[\"rank\"]}, {\"rank S (+400 triples)\", wsRes1b[\"rank\"]}, {\"dim S12 (<=2)\", wsRes1[\"dimS12\"]}, {\"dim S12 (+triples)\", wsRes1b[\"dimS12\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"145\" data-out-n=\"1319\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"20\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1319]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHtyYW5rIFMgKDw9MiBmYWN0b3JzKX0gJiAzN1xcXGhsaW5lXHRleHR7cmFuayBTICgrNDAwIHRyaXBsZXMpfSAmIDkzXFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHtkaW0gUzEyICg8PTIpfSAmIDRcXFxobGluZVx0ZXh0e2RpbSBTMTIgKCt0cmlwbGVzKX0gJiA0XFxcaGxpbmVcZW5ke2FycmF5fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.84em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank S (&lt;=2 factors)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank S (+400 triples)</span></span></sp