  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Summary\n- Conventions verified: [t1,t1]=[t1,t3]=0 for G_c(z); <0_w| exact eigenbra of w-twisted t1, t3.\n- Words with <=2 factors (703): rank S = 37 (both generic w), dim S12 = 4. With 400 random triples rank S = 93, dim S12 stays 4.\n- Generic w: S12 = span{ v(x)u, vG^-T(x)u, vG^-T(x)uG, S - kappa v(x)uG }, kappa = theta12/(h q). The last state equals <0_w|t1(theta2) up to a scalar (entangled, rank 4). v(x)uG, vG^T(x)u, S, vG^T(x)uG, v(x)uG^-1 are NOT in S12.\n- Rank-1 locus: (a) vG^-T (x) u(a+bG): v' = vG^-T != v_w, u' != u_w, B1 = u G^-1 v, B2 = b q (both nonzero); (b) v(a+bG^-T) (x) u: B2 = 0.\n- t1(theta2)-t1(theta1) is NOT localised at L=4 (t1(theta1) alone changes sites 3,4).\n- Locus w1=z1: rank S = 9, dim S12 = 3, all rank 1, v' = v_w frozen, u' free in a 3-dim space; B1 = 0.\n- Skipped: fully symbolic 2-site computation.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Word span on the pair {1,2} for generic w (L=4, A F A F)\nAll symbols prefixed `ws`. Exact rational arithmetic.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "wsTest = 1+1",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  }
